{"id":"ac4f2389d6a4143b","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-string-trs-translation.md","title":"字符串到一元项的翻译","display":"df-string-trs-translation — 字符串到一元项的翻译","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-string-trs-translation","aliases":["56-df-string-trs-translation"],"display":"df-string-trs-translation — 字符串到一元项的翻译","depends_on":["[[56-df-string-rewriting-system]]","[[56-df-rewrite-system]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Example 3.4.10, printed p78","source_ocr_block":"99","source_status":"source-example-generalized-with-explicit-nonempty-left-condition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-string-trs-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-string-trs-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-string-trs-translation — 字符串到一元项的翻译"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"05f15a105b760502\" href=\"?note=05f15a105b760502\" title=\"56-df-string-rewriting-system\">56-df-string-rewriting-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Example 3.4.10, printed p78"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"99"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-example-generalized-with-explicit-nonempty-left-condition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SRS}(A,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{SRS}(A,R)\\)</span>，并假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;(l\\ne\\epsilon)\">\\(\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;(l\\ne\\epsilon)\\)</span>。为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span> 取一个新的一元符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\">\\(\\bar a\\)</span>，再取新常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span>。符号均互异且与变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 不交。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span> 为固定变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 为目标签名的项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in A^*\">\\(w\\in A^*\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_A\\coloneqq\\{o\\}\\cup\\{\\bar a:a\\in A\\},\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_A(o)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_A(\\bar a)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\Sigma_A\\coloneqq(F_A,\\mathrm{ar}_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_A\\coloneqq\\{o\\}\\cup\\{\\bar a:a\\in A\\},\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_A(o)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_A(\\bar a)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\Sigma_A\\coloneqq(F_A,\\mathrm{ar}_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\iota_\\epsilon(t)\\coloneqq t,\\qquad\\iota_{aw}(t)\\coloneqq\\bar a(\\iota_w(t)),\\qquad⟦ w⟧\\coloneqq\\iota_w(o).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\iota_\\epsilon(t)\\coloneqq t,\\qquad\\iota_{aw}(t)\\coloneqq\\bar a(\\iota_w(t)),\\qquad⟦ w⟧\\coloneqq\\iota_w(o).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_A\\coloneqq\\{(\\iota_l(x),\\iota_r(x)):(l,r)\\in R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_A\\coloneqq\\{(\\iota_l(x),\\iota_r(x)):(l,r)\\in R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Example 3.4.10（印刷 p78，OCR 页块99）使用一元符号与尾部常元 o。本节点把例子推广为显式翻译。非空左部保证翻译后左侧不是变量；右部只使用同一个尾变量，因此满足普通 TRS 的变量条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-string-rewriting-system","status":"resolved","id":"05f15a105b760502","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-string-rewriting-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SRS}(A,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;(l\\ne\\epsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a","display":false},{"tex":"o","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in A^*","display":false},{"tex":"F_A\\coloneqq\\{o\\}\\cup\\{\\bar a:a\\in A\\},\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_A(o)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_A(\\bar a)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\Sigma_A\\coloneqq(F_A,\\mathrm{ar}_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota_\\epsilon(t)\\coloneqq t,\\qquad\\iota_{aw}(t)\\coloneqq\\bar a(\\iota_w(t)),\\qquad⟦ w⟧\\coloneqq\\iota_w(o).","display":true},{"tex":"R_A\\coloneqq\\{(\\iota_l(x),\\iota_r(x)):(l,r)\\in R\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1467,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-266","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-string-trs-translation.md]]"},{"id":"2b8f8c2d3844ca91","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-string-trs-translation]] 的有限字母表、非空左部规则、翻译 $⟦-⟧$ 与 $R_A$。$u,v\\in A^*$。$\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_A)$ 的基项记号见 [[56-df-ground-terms]]。"}],"outgoing":["05f15a105b760502","a6c29a8d098ef0ed"]}